// Stage 0 (mlx0) has no atomic lowering and rejects every atomic builtin with
// MLX-E9001; this calls @fence without its order. The canonical compiler
// implements the atomics (spec atomics-tls.xml, CallShapes) and rejects this
// program for its arity alone: tests/295_atomics_runtime.mlx is their test.
pub fn main() u8 {
    @fence()
    return 0
}
